WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.300
- Do you ever see kids
dressed up as y'all,

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.673
like from "Pitch Perfect" or anything?

00:00:03.673 --> 00:00:08.019
- I get very creeped out when I see kids

00:00:08.019 --> 00:00:08.852
(laughing)

00:00:08.852 --> 00:00:12.200
dressed up as like my
character from "Get Out."

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.171
Seems a little.

00:00:13.171 --> 00:00:14.004
- No.
- Scary.

00:00:14.004 --> 00:00:15.250
- [Bradley] Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:16.782
- Why are children watching that?

00:00:16.782 --> 00:00:18.010
(laughing)

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:20.250
- Like that film gave me nightmares.

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:22.660
I loved it, but then I was like, whoa.

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:23.980
- Yeah, you don't want
to see a nine-year-old

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:24.992
in a turtleneck.

00:00:24.992 --> 00:00:26.632
(laughing)
(clapping)

00:00:26.632 --> 00:00:28.670
- Or do you, or do you?

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:30.150
(laughing)
(clapping)

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:32.040
- I heard, okay speaking of Halloween,

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:34.040
I heard that you have
like a scary ghost story.

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:36.040
- I do, I do, I just got back

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:38.580
from shooting a little movie in Mexico.

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:40.460
And we went to this very small town

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:42.360
outside of Mexico City called Cuernavaca.

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:45.650
And we stayed in this
very, very old hacienda.

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:47.320
It's built in the 1500s.

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:49.460
And we rented out the whole place.

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:51.120
So there were no other
guests staying there.

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:52.630
And I had a night-shoot,

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:54.570
so I was walking around
the hacienda by myself,

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:56.910
like outside on the balcony
trying to get service.

00:00:56.910 --> 00:01:01.400
And I feel somebody touch
my face and I freak out.

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:02.630
And I run back to my hotel room

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:03.567
and I'm like, "Leave me
alone, leave me alone,

00:01:03.567 --> 00:01:04.400
"what just happened?"

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:05.448
- Nope.

00:01:05.448 --> 00:01:06.281
- And then as I'm in the hotel room,

00:01:06.281 --> 00:01:08.260
it's thundering and lightning
and the power goes out.

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:09.093
- [Kelly] Sure.

00:01:09.093 --> 00:01:10.890
- So I scream at the top of my lungs,

00:01:10.890 --> 00:01:12.010
I go I can't take this anymore.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:14.047
I'm like, "Leave me alone,
I love it here, I'm not mad.

00:01:14.047 --> 00:01:15.671
"Why are you mad at me?"

00:01:15.671 --> 00:01:16.504
(laughing)

00:01:16.504 --> 00:01:17.800
And I go down to the lobby
after the power comes on

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:20.884
and he's like, "Oh so
that was Hernan Cortes."

00:01:20.884 --> 00:01:21.717
- [Kelly] What?

00:01:21.717 --> 00:01:22.551
- And I said, "Excuse me?"

00:01:22.551 --> 00:01:23.384
(laughing)

00:01:23.384 --> 00:01:24.372
I was like, "So you know this guy?"

00:01:24.372 --> 00:01:25.660
- I love that someone
was like, "Oh that's."

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:27.670
- He's apparently the founder of Mexico

00:01:27.670 --> 00:01:29.610
and he haunts that hacienda

00:01:29.610 --> 00:01:31.560
and that has happened to people before.

